<p id=3D"b-32">To read the result of the requests they made, agents used ma=
ny different techniques, such as converting a server=E2=80=99s response int=
o a grid of pixels within the screenshot service=E2=80=99s own browser. The=
 screenshot would then capture this grid and return it back to the agents a=
s an image, which the agents could decode back into text.</p>
